      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَحٌ</span></b>  <i>A place to which one has recourse for
protection</i> or <i>concealment; a place of refuge;
an asylum:</i> (L:) [as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَحَجٌ</span>:] <i>a place
